1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,800
We sat on the bank of the river
and watched the water flow past.

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:07,210
Later that day, I went to the
bank to deposit my salary.

3
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:10,590
Dark clouds gathered over the
hills just before the rain.

4
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:14,070
Last year, our company moved
all of its files to the cloud.

5
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,820
A tiny mouse ran across the kitchen floor.

6
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,420
Click the left mouse
button to open the file.

7
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:23,270
At the zoo, a python lay
curled around a thick branch.

8
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:26,510
Python is a popular language
for writing software.

9
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:29,850
Good friends add real value to your life.
